  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the required unit vector be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br />Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math>...(i)<br /><br />Since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> makes an angle of <math><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and an angle of <math><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math> therefore<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover></math>",
